{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "OrchLab Instruments API",
    "version": "1.0.0-draft",
    "description": "Save and reload work from the SoundMakers instruments on the OrchLab website. **Status: draft only.**\n\n## How it works\n\nEach save is an **item** with an `instrument` (`sampler`), a `type` chosen by the instrument (e.g. `sound`, `padset`) and a `data` object. The API stores `data` exactly as sent and doesn't check its contents, so instruments can change their format without a WordPress update. Saves are private to the logged-in user.\n\nAudio and images are uploaded first with `POST /files`, which returns an id. Use that id in `data` and list it in the item's `fileIds`. Files no item lists are **deleted after 24 hours**. Saved items come back with a `files` list containing each file's URL, which only works for its owner.\n\nThe sampler's draft fields go inside `data`. The draft's `id`, `title` and `created_at` become item fields. Its `audioUrl`/`imageUrl`/`imageUrls` become file ids (`audioFileId`, `imageFileId`, `imageFileIds`). See the `POST /items` examples.\n\n## Logging in\n\nInstruments run on the same domain as WordPress, so requests carry the WordPress login cookie. WordPress also requires a **security token** with it. (WordPress's own names for this, like the `X-WP-Nonce` header, use the technical term \"nonce\".)\n\n1. Get a token: `GET /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=rest-nonce`. Logged out, this returns `400` with body `0`.\n2. Send it as the `X-WP-Nonce` header on every API request.\n3. If a request fails with `403 rest_cookie_invalid_nonce`, the token has expired. Get a new one and retry.\n\nThen check `GET /me`: show save controls only if `instruments.sampler.enabled` is true.\n\n## Things to know\n\n- **schemaVersion:** if your `data` format changes, increase it and upgrade older items when you load them. The API never changes `data`.\n- **Missing references:** deleting a sound doesn't update pad sets that use it. Treat a missing sound as an empty pad.\n- **Errors** use the WordPress format `{ code, message, data: { status } }`. Rely on `code`, not `message`.\n- **Limits:** 10 MB per file (to be agreed), 200 MB storage per user, 256 KB of `data`, 30 saves/uploads per minute. Images are resized to 512 px and photo metadata is removed.\n\n## Development\n\n- **Mock:** this file can run as a mock server, e.g. `npx @stoplight/prism-cli mock openapi.json`.\n- **Local WordPress:** proxy `/wp-json`, `/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php` and `/orchlab-instruments-file` from your dev server to the local site, so the login cookie is sent.\n- **Another domain (e.g. Netlify), staging only:** use an application password for a test account (`Authorization: Basic`, no token needed). Ask the site admin to allow your site's address, and load files from `GET /files/{id}/content`. Never put an application password in a production build.\n"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/wp-json/orchlab-sampler/v1",
      "description": "The WordPress site the instrument runs on"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "wpCookie": [],
      "wpToken": []
    },
    {
      "appPassword": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Me",
      "description": "The current user and what they can do."
    },
    {
      "name": "Items",
      "description": "Saved work, such as sounds and pad sets."
    },
    {
      "name": "Files",
      "description": "Uploaded audio and images, used by items."
    },
    {
      "name": "WordPress",
      "description": "Endpoints outside this API that instruments also use."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Me"
        ],
        "summary": "Get the current user",
        "description": "Works logged out too, without a token. Without a token it always reports `loggedIn` as `false`, even for a logged-in user.",
        "operationId": "getMe",
        "security": [
          {},
          {
            "wpCookie": [],
            "wpToken": []
          },
          {
            "appPassword": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The current user, their storage use and which instruments they can save with.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Me"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "loggedIn": {
                    "summary": "Logged in",
                    "value": {
                      "loggedIn": true,
                      "userId": 7,
                      "displayName": "Sam",
                      "loginUrl": "https://orchlab.org/wp-login.php",
                      "quotaUsed": 1048576,
                      "quotaLimit": 209715200,
                      "instruments": {
                        "sampler": {
                          "enabled": true,
                          "maxFileBytes": 10485760,
                          "allowedMimes": [
                            "audio/mpeg",
                            "image/jpeg",
                            "image/png"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "loggedOut": {
                    "summary": "Logged out",
                    "value": {
                      "loggedIn": false,
                      "userId": 0,
                      "displayName": null,
                      "loginUrl": "https://orchlab.org/wp-login.php",
                      "quotaUsed": 0,
                      "quotaLimit": 0,
                      "instruments": {
                        "sampler": {
                          "enabled": true,
                          "maxFileBytes": 10485760,
                          "allowedMimes": [
                            "audio/mpeg",
                            "image/jpeg",
                            "image/png"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/items": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Items"
        ],
        "summary": "List items",
        "description": "The current user's items for an instrument, newest `updatedAt` first.",
        "operationId": "listItems",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/InstrumentQuery"
          },
          {
            "name": "type",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Only return items of this type.",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemType"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "default": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "perPage",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 100,
              "default": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "A page of items.",
            "headers": {
              "X-WP-Total": {
                "description": "Total number of matching items.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "X-WP-TotalPages": {
                "description": "Total number of pages.",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Item"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Items"
        ],
        "summary": "Create an item",
        "description": "Upload any files first with `POST /files`, then list their ids in `fileIds`.",
        "operationId": "createItem",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemCreate"
              },
              "examples": {
                "sound": {
                  "summary": "Save a sound",
                  "value": {
                    "instrument": "sampler",
                    "type": "sound",
                    "title": "Door slam",
                    "schemaVersion": 1,
                    "data": {
                      "padIndex": 0,
                      "audioFileId": 101,
                      "imageFileId": 102,
                      "backgroundColor": "#E63946"
                    },
                    "fileIds": [
                      101,
                      102
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "padset": {
                  "summary": "Save a pad set",
                  "value": {
                    "instrument": "sampler",
                    "type": "padset",
                    "title": "My first kit",
                    "schemaVersion": 1,
                    "data": {
                      "soundIds": [
                        40,
                        41,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null
                      ],
                      "imageFileIds": [
                        null,
                        103,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null,
                        null
                      ],
                      "backgroundColors": [
                        "#E63946",
                        "#F4A261",
                        "#2A9D8F",
                        "#264653",
                        "#8AB17D",
                        "#E9C46A",
                        "#6D597A",
                        "#457B9D"
                      ],
                      "gridOrientation": "portrait"
                    },
                    "fileIds": [
                      103
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "The saved item.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Item"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "sound": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/SoundItem"
                  },
                  "padset": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/PadSetItem"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/DataTooLarge"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/items/{id}": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/components/parameters/ItemId"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Items"
        ],
        "summary": "Get an item",
        "operationId": "getItem",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The item.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Item"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "sound": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/SoundItem"
                  },
                  "padset": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/PadSetItem"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Items"
        ],
        "summary": "Update an item",
        "description": "Send only the fields to change. Each one **replaces** the stored value: `data` is not merged, so send all of it. Last write wins.\n\nFiles dropped from `fileIds` that no other item uses are deleted after 24 hours.\n",
        "operationId": "updateItem",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemUpdate"
              },
              "examples": {
                "rename": {
                  "summary": "Rename",
                  "value": {
                    "title": "Kitchen sounds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The updated item.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Item"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/DataTooLarge"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Items"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete an item",
        "description": "Also deletes the item's files, unless another of your items uses them.",
        "operationId": "deleteItem",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Deleted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemDeleted"
                },
                "example": {
                  "deleted": true,
                  "id": 40,
                  "deletedFileIds": [
                    101,
                    102
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/files": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Files"
        ],
        "summary": "Upload a file",
        "description": "Upload one file, then use its id in an item. A file no item uses is deleted after 24 hours.\n\nThe sampler accepts MP3 (`audio/mpeg`), JPG and PNG. Images are re-encoded (max 512 px, metadata removed), so use the returned `bytes`, not the original size.\n",
        "operationId": "uploadFile",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "file",
                  "instrument"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "file": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary",
                    "description": "The audio or image file."
                  },
                  "instrument": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Instrument"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "The uploaded file.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FileUploaded"
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": 101,
                  "url": "https://orchlab.org/orchlab-instruments-file/101",
                  "mime": "audio/mpeg",
                  "bytes": 48213,
                  "createdAt": "2026-10-08T14:00:58Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/FileTooLarge"
          },
          "415": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/UnsupportedType"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "507": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/QuotaExceeded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/files/{id}": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "in": "path",
          "required": true,
          "schema": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      ],
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Files"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete a file",
        "description": "Only for files no item uses, e.g. an upload you decided not to save. Files used by items are deleted with the item.",
        "operationId": "deleteFile",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Deleted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FileDeleted"
                },
                "example": {
                  "deleted": true,
                  "id": 101
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "An item still uses this file.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "code": "oli_file_in_use",
                  "message": "This file is used by a saved item.",
                  "data": {
                    "status": 409,
                    "itemIds": [
                      40
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/files/{id}/content": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Files"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a file's contents",
        "description": "The file itself, through the API. Use this when testing from another domain, where each file's `url` won't work. Supports `Range` requests.",
        "operationId": "getFileContent",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The file.",
            "content": {
              "audio/mpeg": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "image/jpeg": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "image/png": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "Part of the file, for a `Range` request."
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotLoggedIn"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "/",
          "description": "The WordPress site root"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "WordPress"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a security token",
        "description": "WordPress core. Uses the login cookie only. Send the result as `X-WP-Nonce` on API requests.",
        "operationId": "getSecurityToken",
        "security": [
          {
            "wpCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "action",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "rest-nonce"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Logged in. The body is the token.",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "example": "a1b2c3d4e5"
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Logged out. The body is `0`.",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "example": "0"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/orchlab-instruments-file/{id}": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "/",
          "description": "The WordPress site root"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Files"
        ],
        "summary": "Download a file",
        "description": "The `url` given for each file. Only works for the file's owner. Uses the login cookie, no token. Supports `Range` requests.",
        "operationId": "downloadFile",
        "security": [
          {
            "wpCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The file.",
            "content": {
              "audio/mpeg": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "image/jpeg": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "image/png": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "Part of the file, for a `Range` request."
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found, or not yours."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "wpCookie": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "cookie",
        "name": "wordpress_logged_in_{hash}",
        "description": "The WordPress login cookie. The browser sends it automatically on same-origin requests."
      },
      "appPassword": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "basic",
        "description": "Development on another domain only: a WordPress username and application password, on staging. See \"Testing from another domain\"."
      },
      "wpToken": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-WP-Nonce",
        "description": "Security token from `GET /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=rest-nonce`. Required with the cookie on API requests."
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "InstrumentQuery": {
        "name": "instrument",
        "in": "query",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Instrument"
        }
      },
      "ItemId": {
        "name": "id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Instrument": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "sampler"
        ],
        "description": "The instrument the item or file belongs to."
      },
      "ItemType": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9-]{1,32}$",
        "description": "Chosen by the instrument, e.g. `sound` or `padset`.",
        "examples": [
          "sound",
          "padset"
        ]
      },
      "Item": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "instrument",
          "type",
          "title",
          "schemaVersion",
          "data",
          "fileIds",
          "files",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "instrument": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Instrument"
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemType"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "Version of the instrument's `data` format for this type."
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Owned by the instrument. Stored and returned exactly as sent."
          },
          "fileIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Every file this item uses."
          },
          "files": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/File"
            },
            "description": "Details and URL for each id in `fileIds`."
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "ItemCreate": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "instrument",
          "type",
          "schemaVersion",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "instrument": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Instrument"
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ItemType"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 100,
            "default": "",
            "description": "Plain text. HTML is removed."
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Any JSON object, up to 256 KB once encoded."
          },
          "fileIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "maxItems": 32,
            "uniqueItems": true,
            "default": [],
            "description": "Every file used in `data`. Each must be one of your uploads."
          }
        }
      },
      "ItemUpdate": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Any of these fields. Each replaces the stored value.",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "fileIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "maxItems": 32,
            "uniqueItems": true
          }
        }
      },
      "ItemDeleted": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "deleted": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "const": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "deletedFileIds": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "File": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "url",
          "mime",
          "bytes"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Only works for the logged-in owner."
          },
          "mime": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "audio/mpeg"
            ]
          },
          "bytes": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "FileUploaded": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/File"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "createdAt"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "createdAt": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "FileDeleted": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "deleted": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "const": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "Me": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "loggedIn",
          "userId",
          "displayName",
          "loginUrl",
          "quotaUsed",
          "quotaLimit",
          "instruments"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "loggedIn": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "userId": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "0 when logged out."
          },
          "displayName": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "loginUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "quotaUsed": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Bytes used, across all instruments."
          },
          "quotaLimit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Bytes allowed. 0 when logged out."
          },
          "instruments": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "enabled": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "Show save controls only when true. When logged out, true means \"offer a login prompt\"."
                },
                "maxFileBytes": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "allowedMimes": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Stable. Base app behaviour on this."
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "For logs. May change."
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "status"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        }
      }
    },
